      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00549",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "盖在被炉上的被子原封不动。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The quilt covering the kotatsu had been left just as it was.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00549",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "也就是说，将另一床被子搭在它的上面。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In other words, another quilt had been laid over it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00549",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "褥子一直铺到被炉边。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The mattress was spread all the way to the edge of the kotatsu.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
