    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00549",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "只铺了一个睡铺。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only one bed had been laid out.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00549",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "驹子在被炉边烤火，低下头来，一声不响。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Komako was warming herself by the kotatsu, her head bowed, without saying a word.",
          "g": "predicate"
